        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "26f04bf5-0887-31a9-897a-b32b9baeb1e5",
                "word": "apoplectique",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e079f7aa-25f6-4ebb-bd16-6daff67a3532",
                        "entry_id": "26f04bf5-0887-31a9-897a-b32b9baeb1e5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "apoplectiques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fcb2e3a5-9479-3def-a420-31e85425684f",
                        "entry_id": "26f04bf5-0887-31a9-897a-b32b9baeb1e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a rapport à l’apoplexie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf1ca3ab-3e99-4e89-a8d8-369795372925",
                                "sense_id": "fcb2e3a5-9479-3def-a420-31e85425684f",
                                "text": "Symptôme apoplectique."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a18976bc-cdf1-348e-be54-81a2dd8b4945",
                        "entry_id": "26f04bf5-0887-31a9-897a-b32b9baeb1e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui paraît menacé d’apoplexie ou qui en a eu des attaques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab5f41b8-e411-4ec4-8d70-04754c11695a",
                                "sense_id": "a18976bc-cdf1-348e-be54-81a2dd8b4945",
                                "text": "Le juez de letras, don Inigo tormentos Albaceyte, était un homme de quelque cinquante ans, petit et replet, à la face apoplectique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e96ed8f7-95e6-4908-bb3d-8187228830fd",
                                "sense_id": "a18976bc-cdf1-348e-be54-81a2dd8b4945",
                                "text": "Peut-être cette incroyable proposition, dit un vieux commodore apoplectique, n’a-t-elle eu d’autre but que de nous mystifier !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "181a413b-da4c-4081-b862-b5145b8352b1",
                                "sense_id": "a18976bc-cdf1-348e-be54-81a2dd8b4945",
                                "text": "Herr Schultze avait repris un peu de calme apparent. Toutefois, le tremblement de ses lèvres, la pâleur qui avait succédé à la rougeur apoplectique de sa face montraient assez les sentiments qui l’agitaient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a5d8bfa-4f15-4241-9e15-adb8977e66e8",
                                "sense_id": "a18976bc-cdf1-348e-be54-81a2dd8b4945",
                                "text": "A petits pas gourds, chaussé de chaussons, un vieux gaga apoplectique, rhumatismal, ataxique et blanc, dont par derrière les kellner se gaussaient, le goguenardant et tournant en bourrique, vint s’attabler à un autre coin ; […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "649bb24f-23f8-4d1b-b670-3942c116b67b",
                        "source_entry_id": "26f04bf5-0887-31a9-897a-b32b9baeb1e5",
                        "target_lang_word": "apoplektisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apoplektisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63bf672c-dd95-371e-a4a6-2f5d69b01b57",
                                        "entry_id": "013f7890-2cd9-3707-8c5a-0587bf9593d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zur Apoplexie neigend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a37bda9f-1c77-49b5-b391-3027f19e29e9",
                                                "sense_id": "63bf672c-dd95-371e-a4a6-2f5d69b01b57",
                                                "text": "„NEF [Notarzteinsatzfahrzeug] und RTW [Rettungswagen] werden zu einem 72-jährigen Patienten gerufen, bei dem die Diagnose eines apoplektischen Insults gestellt wurde.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "63bf364c-48b7-4e89-b5b5-f425a65ebf1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "26f04bf5-0887-31a9-897a-b32b9baeb1e5",
                        "target_lang_word": "apoplectic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apoplectic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "455634cd-7ba8-384f-8c54-d9b4937ff4b7",
                                        "entry_id": "8bf31196-df0e-328c-bd2d-95439aa4c996",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to apoplexy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97965cd8-6f52-3e8f-a03c-695643411143",
                                        "entry_id": "8bf31196-df0e-328c-bd2d-95439aa4c996",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marked by extreme anger or fury."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b206b52b-517a-4c6b-8c63-7da3dae445a5",
                                                "sense_id": "97965cd8-6f52-3e8f-a03c-695643411143",
                                                "text": "Once she heard Jem refer to our father as 'Atticus' and her reaction was apoplectic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45bed480-caed-4906-829f-13b1011b7984",
                                                "sense_id": "97965cd8-6f52-3e8f-a03c-695643411143",
                                                "text": "Speak of the devil—he marches through the door, and becomes apoplectic when he learns of the upheaval."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81d843ee-7b1d-4f72-a01d-8cad41674b1b",
                                                "sense_id": "97965cd8-6f52-3e8f-a03c-695643411143",
                                                "text": "The decision left Potters boss Tony Pulis apoplectic on the touchline, a feeling his West Ham counterpart Avram Grant was to share immediately after the break."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6390aa78-b685-4726-8fda-ede97eae5ea3",
                                                "sense_id": "97965cd8-6f52-3e8f-a03c-695643411143",
                                                "text": "If older man/younger women matchups make many people uncomfortable, the older man/much younger women combo tends to make them apoplectic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "557d9504-4a2a-4694-a06f-dcd5a3f34a0c",
                                                "sense_id": "97965cd8-6f52-3e8f-a03c-695643411143",
                                                "text": "Yet when one relistens to the original Rock, Rot & Rule broadcast, the most salient element is not the comedy. It’s the apoplectic phone calls from random WFMU listeners."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6651accb-35e3-3e65-82e3-6f5bd84a5c10",
                                        "entry_id": "8bf31196-df0e-328c-bd2d-95439aa4c996",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Effused with blood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "apoplectic",
